{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02501","headline":"安德山池宴集 · 刘洎","name":"安德山池宴集","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"平阳擅歌舞，金谷盛招携。\n何如兼往烈，会赏叶幽栖。\n已均朝野致，还欣物我齐。\n春晚花方落，兰深径渐迷。\n蒲新节尚短，荷小盖犹低。\n无劳拂长袖，直待夜乌啼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘洎","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02501.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02501","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}